Shopify Liquid — Selling Fast Product Badge
Overview

This project demonstrates a reusable Shopify Liquid product badge designed to highlight selected products in a Shopify storefront.

The badge uses a product metafield to control visibility, allowing merchants to display the “Selling Fast” label only on products they choose.

Features
Reusable Shopify Liquid snippet
Product-level visibility using a custom metafield
Gold-inspired styling suitable for jewelry and retail storefronts
Responsive CSS for smaller screens
Semantic HTML and an accessible decorative indicator
Technologies
Shopify Liquid
HTML
CSS
Shopify product metafields
Project Structure
snippets/selling-fast-badge.liquid — Liquid logic for displaying the badge
assets/selling-fast-badge.css — badge styling
Setup
Create a product metafield definition with the namespace and key custom.selling_fast.
Set its type to True or false.
Enable the metafield for the products that should display the badge.
Render the snippet in the appropriate product template using:

{% render 'selling-fast-badge', product: product %}

Include the CSS file in the theme so its styles are applied.
Purpose

This demonstration project explores reusable Shopify theme components and configurable product merchandising features.

It was created as a learning and portfolio project to demonstrate Shopify Liquid concepts, storefront styling, and product-level customization.
